/www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darksmithing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/42/638809219586558211.png\" alt=\"DarkSmithing\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkglint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/43/638809219738491863.png\" alt=\"DarkGlint\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkblades\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/865/446/638276537760845844.png\" alt=\"DarkBlades\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darksmelting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/44/638809219930112056.png\" alt=\"DarkSmelting\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkdeath\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/45/638809220133531694.png\" alt=\"DarkDeath\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkbosses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/46/638809220279448018.png\" alt=\"DarkBosses\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/darkzoom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/48/638809220453447305.png\" alt=\"DarkZoom\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/happy-go-lucky\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1235/133/638809254724041629.png\" alt=\"Happy Go Lucky\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-feather\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forg